      "content": "hey, so i was just sitting on the couch and i noticed like a bunch of tiny black spots floating in my vision. it's kinda weird. then i saw this weird shadow or like a dark curtain moving across the side of my eye. my head aches a little bit too. is that normal? should i be worried?",
